    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d334">

                <pb facs="0404" n="388" sameAs="frus:frus1947v08/pg388"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">124.24/7–2547: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Embassy in Bolivia </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">us urgent</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-07-25T12:00:00-04:00">July 25,
                            1947—noon.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>431. Urtel 686 July 23.<anchor n="99" xml:id="d334-f1"/> Emb authorized acquire
                    Ernst residence property free and clear all encumbrance at cost up to 5,500,000
                    bolivianos. Payment Ernst be made by Bolivian Govt through bank against delivery
                    good and sufficient deed in fee simple. See Depcirinstr Sept 20, 1945<anchor
                        n="99" xml:id="d334-f2"/> for procedure. Bolivian Govt to receive credit for
                    dollar equivalent of payment against its obligations to US under lend-lease.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Marshall</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
